OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new #3.5m city centre
OL,4,Alink route unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a #3.5m revamp of part of
OL,7,FLeicester city centre have been
OL,8,Funveiled.
OL,10,FLeicester City Council said it wants to
OL,11,Fdemolish empty shops it owns to create
OL,12,Fa new link between Green Dragon Square
OL,13,Fand St Martin's Square.
OL,15,FThe authority said the scheme would
OL,16,Fcreate a "substantial" new green space
OL,17,Fin the city centre which would include
OL,18,Fa new play area.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
